# Project 7-7 – Z Shell Configuration

## Step 4 – Prompt
Prompt: user1%
Reason: Zsh uses a default prompt with % for normal users.

## Step 6 – Other methods to reload .zshrc
- Restart shell
- Run `zsh`
- Use `. .zshrc`

## Step 7 – Redirection >file1 >file2
Files are identical because both redirections receive the same output.

## Step 8 – Pipe + redirection
file1 = full output
file2 = filtered output (grep protocol)

## Step 9 – sort <file1 <file2
Only last redirection is used → file2 sorted only.

## Step 12 – autocd
pwd shows current directory.
Typing Desktop changes directory automatically.
